# Sprint 1 — Tasks, ADRs y CA — Prode Mundial 2026

## ADR-001 — Strands + Bedrock AgentCore Runtime (APROBADO)

Strands elegido sobre LangChain (breaking changes) y Bedrock Agents nativo (menos control).

```python
# agent/main.py — patrón canónico
app   = BedrockAgentCoreApp()
agent = Agent(model="us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514", tools=[...])

@app.entrypoint
async def agent_invocation(payload: dict):
    stream = agent.stream_async(payload["prompt"])
    async for event in stream:
        yield event

if __name__ == "__main__":
    app.run()
```

Invocación desde Lambda webhook:
```python
response = boto3.client("bedrock-agent-runtime").invoke_agent(
    agentId=AGENT_ID, agentAliasId="LIVE",
    sessionId=session_id, inputText=prompt,
    sessionState={"sessionAttributes": {"user_id": user_id, "platform": "TELEGRAM"}}
)
full_text = ""
for event in response["completion"]:
    chunk = event.get("chunk", {})
    if "bytes" in chunk:
        full_text += chunk["bytes"].decode("utf-8")
```

## ADR-002 — Arquitectura Híbrida DynamoDB + Aurora (APROBADO)

DynamoDB: escrituras transaccionales, lookups sub-5ms, estado efímero (TTL).
Aurora PostgreSQL 16 Serverless v2: queries con JOIN, reporting, ranking relacional.
Sync: DynamoDB Streams → Lambda → upsert idempotente ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE.
RDS Proxy: obligatorio con Lambda, pool máx 10 conexiones.
Alembic: solo en CI/CD, nunca en Lambda runtime.

## ADR-003 — DynamoDB Single-Table Design (APROBADO)

Ver steering.md para patrones PK/SK completos y 4 GSIs.

## ADR-004 — WebSocket Rankings Real-Time (APROBADO)

$connect → registra WS#<connId>/DETAILS (TTL 8h) → post-scoring → ranking_broadcaster → postToConnection.
GoneException → eliminar connId stale de DynamoDB.

## ADR-005 — EventBridge Scheduler Veda (APROBADO)

Job naming: `veda-{match_id}` (determinístico = idempotente).
Lambda veda_activator: UpdateItem con ConditionExpression="veda_active = :false".

